Using a pre-compiled PC version?  Pretty explicit dungeon- and level-
compiler grammar is detailed in man pages that come with the source
package.  Grab them from linc.cis.upenn.edu if you can, or mail me.

The %MULTDGN line is an instruction to makedefs.  The dungeon source
file must be run through 'makedefs -e', then dgn_comp.  I don't know
why -- Mike Stephenson could explain.

